  <item>
    <coll>Gtn</coll>
    <ref>Gtn025.004</ref>
    <rnb>296</rnb>
    <tib>dpal chen he ru ka'i gal po</tib>
    <skt>shrI he ru ka man tra gu h+ya tan tra nA ma</skt>
    <coloph>de nas bsdung pa po rdo rje rnon po la sogs pa/ /he ru ka'i gal po'i lha thams cad kyis thams cad he ru kar rtogs te/ /rtogs pa phul lo/ /stong gsum ye shes dkyil 'khor du/ /dur khrod chen po byang chub lung/ /rtogs chen mnyam sbyor thugs kyi mdzod/ /bshad pas nyams pa'i snying po 'di/ /sangs rgyas gzhan nas spyan mi 'dren/ /nyid las kun rdzogs gzhal yas khang/ /dngos grub gzhan du mi slong ste/ /grub pa'i dkyil 'khor rang la shar/ /re dgos med pa ye nas gnas/ /gzhan nas mi slong nyid la rdzogs/ /mnyam nyid ma skyes mya ngan 'das zhes brjod do/ /shin tu dam zhing ngo tshar skyes nas ston pa la sna dbang lhag nas nyan to/ /de nas yang mngon rdzogs kyi rgyal po'i/ /gnod 'dul lha la sogs pa rnams la bka' stsal ba/ /gnod 'dul lha la sogs pa khyed rnams la ngas chos 'di bsdud la bshad do// dpal he ru ka'i gal po 'di ni// rgya che zhing don zab pa yin te// khyod kyis zin par gyis shig/ rtogs shig chongs shig/ he ru ka'i gal po 'di ni// dper na me dang 'dra ste// chu dun nas che ba ri rab kyang bsreg go/ theg pa chen po 'di ni// nyi ma'i zer dang 'dra ste// 'dzam bu gling bzhi dang/ ri'i rgyal po rnams dang/ kho ra khor yug dang/ gang rgyus dang/ g.ya' ri dang/ brag ri dang/ de'u la sogs thams cad gsal te/ /blang dor dang dbye ba srid mi byed do// de bzhin du ston pa'i thugs rje'i yang nyi ma dang 'dra ste/ /thugs rjes la 'bri bskol med do/ /de bzhin du sems can gyi rnam par shes pa yang de yang 'dra bar 'bri bskom med do/ /de yang mngon rdzogs kyi rgyal pos/ /lha gnod 'dul la sogs pa la bstsal pa/ /stong gi 'jig rten gyi khams sangs rgyas zhing gi rdul rnyed la/ /lus zhing gi rdul rnyed du phul ba bas ni/ /tan tra chen po 'di'i don rtogs pa bsod nams che'o/ /dus gsum gyi sangs rgyas kyi zhing yongs su sbyangs pa bas ni/ /tan tra chen po 'di'i zhal mthong ba bsod nams che'o/ /gang gis rlung gi bye ma snyed kyi sangs rgyas dang/ /byang chub sems dpa' la phyag 'tshal zhing bkur ba bas ni/ / tan tra chen po 'di yis sgrub pa la thang gcig yud tsam bzhugs pa bsod nams che'o/ /bskal pa stong du 'gro ba'i don byas pa bas ni/ /tan tra chen po 'di thang gcig tsam bcangs pa dang/ bklags pa bsod nams che'o// d+myal ba'i 'jig rten gnas ma gyur par thar pa'i lam ma yin// sangs rgyas sems can mya ngan 'das/ sems ni sangs rgyas kun gyi mes// yul ni ma sgrub bde chen klong// yul sems gnyis med spros dang bral// /kun bzang namkha'i mtshan nyid de/ gnod 'dul lha'i sems la gtod/ /tan tra he ru ka'i gal po rdzogso</coloph>
